                "text": "Last week, I was honored to join a bipartisan, bicameral roundtable on women\u2019s health research with colleagues, leading experts, and advocates, including Mandy Moore and Lupita Nyong\u2019o.\n\nWe must prioritize medical research funding to close the research gap on women\u2019s health, expand treatment options, and ensure better care for women across every stage of life.",
