                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "My mom lost her mother to breast cancer when she was 7 years old. My mom later had her own encounter with this terrible disease and survived. As a husband and father to three daughters, I know the stakes of women\u2019s health are deeply important. This Breast Cancer Awareness Month, I remain dedicated to advancing research and improving outcomes for women.",
