                "text": "Had a great conversation with Tucson business leaders about our work in Congress\u2014from strengthening research and development, to eliminating taxes on overtime pay, to ensuring rural AZ06 receives its fair share of the Rural Health Transformation Program.\n\nI\u2019m proud to carry the voice and priorities of AZ06 in D.C.",
