                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Excited to welcome Alex Fink into his new role as Legislative Director!\n\nFor more than two years, Alex has been a core part of our office \u2014 leading on appropriations, veterans\u2019 issues, national security, health care, and more. His strong commitment to public service brings strength and expertise to our team. Look forward to him driving our policy portfolio forward for AZ06 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8",
