                "retweet_count": 4,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "This #NationalRuralHealthDay, I want to recognize the incredible rural health care providers in Cochise, Pinal, Graham, and Greenlee counties whose work day in and day out addresses the unique health care needs of our rural communities.\n\nRecently, I\u2019m proud to have led multiple efforts to bring AZ its fair share of the Rural Health Transformation Program created by the Working Families Tax Cut Act. In October, I also joined the bipartisan Congressional Rural Caucus to be a voice in D.C. for our rural health communities.\n\nOur rural hospitals and clinics are lifelines\u2014we can\u2019t leave any AZ community behind.",
