                "text": "Proud to join @RepJoshG and @RepJenKiggans at today\u2019s press conference to unveil our health care framework and to urge Senate and House leaders to act.\n\nRising health care costs are already squeezing Arizona families. Premium hikes will make it worse. The time to act is now. https://t.co/CoLrlTqD6s",
